        <mxCell id="notes-box" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Worth knowing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;- Where the numbers live:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;ecsdemo-frontend/cdk/app.py&lt;/code&gt; sets desired_count=3, min_capacity=1, max_capacity=10, target_utilization_percent=30 and 30 s cooldowns.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;- Auxiliary:&lt;/b&gt; CloudWatch Logs collects &lt;code&gt;/ecs/ecsdemo-*&lt;/code&gt; through the awslogs driver. It is not part of the scaling loop.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;- Cost:&lt;/b&gt; roughly USD 0.50 to 1.00 per hour. Run &lt;code&gt;cdk destroy&lt;/code&gt; in reverse order when you finish.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=light-dark(#F5F5F5,#29393B);strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontFamily=Helvetica;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
